<title>UK: Hambros leads 60 million stg asset-backed bond.</title>
<headline>Hambros leads 60 million stg asset-backed bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following asset-backed bond was announced by lead manager Hambros Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SANCTUARY HOUSING ASSOCIATION</p>
<p> AMT    60 MLN STG    COUPON     **	  EXP AVE LIFE 30.4 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    06.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.625     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+75</p>
<p> MOODY	*AA2	LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  *AA-	DENOMS    ONE POUND  GOV LAW     ENGLISH</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 8.0 PCT 2021 TREASURY STOCK</p>
<p> NOTES	*EXPECTED RATING</p>
<p>	     **TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>		 FIRST MORTGAGE DEBENTURE STOCK. SECURED BY STOCK ON</p>
<p>		 SOCIAL HOUSING. INTEREST WILL BE PAID UNTIL 2014</p>
<p>		 THEREAFTER 65.0 PCT OF THE PRINCIPAL UNTIL</p>
<p>		 01.SEP.31 WITH FINAL REDEMPTION ON 01.SEP.31 OF 35</p>
<p>		 PCT OF PRINCIPAL</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
